is set apart","why":"40 of those items separate the link from its description with a dash. The link is now set in the display face at a larger size with a chevron after it, so the dash marks a boundary that is already unmistakable. Only the separator is removed — no word changes.","value":"40 separators"},{"id":"items","on":true,"label":"Separate a link from its description","why":"40 list items open with a link and then explain it, all at the same weight — so the thing you can click is no easier to find than the sentence about it. The link becomes the item and the explanation sits under it.","value":"40 items"},{"id":"banner-graphic","on":true,"label":"Retire the old banner graphic","why":"It repeats the page title in picture form, which the new banner already does in type.","removes":"School Finance - General Purpose Aid Funding Details Web Banner.png"},{"id":"descap","on":true,"label":"Start a description with a capital","why":"1 description begins with a small letter, because it used to run on from the link after a dash. The dash is gone and the link now sits above in its own face, so each description opens a line of its own. One character changes and only ever the first.","value":"1 description"},{"id":"toc","on":true,"label":"Add a contents list (5 sections)","why":"Built from the section headings already on the page. Below three sections a list is not a route."},{"id":"eyebrow","on":true,"label":"Eyebrow: \"Essential Programs and Services (EPS) Funding\"","why":"Taken from the parent page, /funding/gpa/eps."}],"mechanical":["empty paragraphs removed: 1","drupal entity attrs stripped: 180","inline layout styles stripped: 16","default-value styles dropped: 1","paragraph inside a list item unwrapped: 1","style attributes that declare nothing removed: 4","inline styles removed from spans: 14","redundant bold inside a heading removed: 1","bare spans unwrapped: 31","action links marked: 6","format labels chipped: 9","format chip moved out of the link: 5","space mov